{"name": "Alien Dark Wars", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">After a secret mission to recover alien wreckage goes terribly wrong, race to stop UFOs abducting soldiers in real time, confront hostile forces, and uncover a truth hidden for centuries that could ignite a war between worlds.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Intense Aerial Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pilot combat helicopters with realistic physics-based flight. Combine precise shooting, tactical maneuvers, and alien-enhanced firepower to defend soldiers from hostile alien waves and stop UFO abductions in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303890/extras/7136531200aea655ff987346ed8aed13.poster.avif?t=1783082777\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303890/extras/7136531200aea655ff987346ed8aed13.webm?t=1783082777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303890/extras/7136531200aea655ff987346ed8aed13.mp4?t=1783082777\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Biomes and Campaign</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight across tropical islands, harsh deserts, and frozen mountain landscapes in a mission-driven campaign. Each chapter introduces new enemies, environmental challenges, and key rescue missions that drive the story forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303890/extras/bd90de045edb8efd80cc332ab5678be4.poster.avif?t=1783082777\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303890/extras/bd90de045edb8efd80cc332ab5678be4.webm?t=1783082777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303890/extras/bd90de045edb8efd80cc332ab5678be4.mp4?t=1783082777\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Helicopter Evolution</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start with the agile Little Bird and unlock the more powerful Cobra. Upgrade your weapons and helicopter systems to transform conventional firepower into alien technology, and turn the hunters into the hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303890/extras/af9077cd5c5fa9096480182a2468dfa4.poster.avif?t=1783082777\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303890/extras/af9077cd5c5fa9096480182a2468dfa4.webm?t=1783082777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303890/extras/af9077cd5c5fa9096480182a2468dfa4.mp4?t=1783082777\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story and Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rescue key survivors before they are taken, uncover the secrets behind the alien invasion, and reveal a truth hidden for centuries that could ignite a war between worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303890/extras/3c7e36a8d85dc0ce89fd1b3a071a9ec1.poster.avif?t=1783082777\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303890/extras/3c7e36a8d85dc0ce89fd1b3a071a9ec1.webm?t=1783082777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303890/extras/3c7e36a8d85dc0ce89fd1b3a071a9ec1.mp4?t=1783082777\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "A third-person helicopter action shooter featuring realistic physics-based flight enhanced by alien technology. Extract stranded soldiers before hostile alien forces capture them across open maps set in three distinct biomes, with optional first-person gameplay and four selectable camera views.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303890/d4af228c8ac4bf4dcf0d2b4655dd0513cd7801c3/header.jpg?t=1783082777", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Flight", "Vehicular Combat", "Action", "Shooter", "Third-Person Shooter", "Wargame"], "developers": "PANX Games", "publishers": "PANX Games", "release_date": "2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3303890", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "5 February 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/N6Gfi1bSC_U", "first_seen": 1738710000.0, "review_rank": 1930}